# Symphony Worker: Review Repair

The reviewer found contract-entitled gate defects in the previous implementation. Repair the reviewed issue without expanding scope.

{% include "partials/issue_context.md.liquid" %}

## Required Behavior

- Address only the reviewer gate findings appended below.
- Treat discovery findings as non-directed context unless the current run directive explicitly asks you to repair them.
- Revalidate the full issue contract, not only the changed lines.
- For an accepted expected-red artifact, repair the test artifact only; do not absorb its implementation successor. Re-run the declared command and replace `artifactEvidence` with the corrected intended failure.
- For an implementation seeded from a `Dependency Artifact Checkpoint`, preserve the inherited tests and prove the checkpoint command is green in `dependencyArtifactResult`.
- Preserve correct completed work unless the reviewer evidence proves it is wrong.
- Submit completion only after validation evidence proves every requirement and reviewer finding.
